WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 7 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
No, no. It's not gold.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
But it's definitely not a feral.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
It's just stunted.

4
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Poisoned by my blood.

5
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Duke Valmar.

6
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
They say you're the best healer alive.

7
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Can you save it?

8
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.000
I see.

9
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
If we make it out of this alive,

10
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
I swear I'll do whatever it takes to save it.

11
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.390
I'm Aris.

12
00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:23.390
I'm almost 20.

13
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.390
I'm just a floor scubber, a dragon rider academy.

14
00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:29.390
I'll probably never be a dragon rider in my entire life.

15
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.390
My son.

16
00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:34.390
He'd be exactly his age right now.

17
00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:37.390
The day he was born,

18
00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:40.390
the storm broke into the shape of a massive winged dragon.

19
00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:44.390
The elders sworn he was born to be a dragon rider.

20
00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:46.390
Enough!

21
00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:48.390
You filthy little errand boy!

22
00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.390
Who the hell sent you in here with that dark magic rock?

23
00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:54.390
Give me a name, and I might just let you bleed out fast.

24
00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:55.390
I'll push another front.

25
00:00:55.390 --> 00:01:04.070
Slaughter them!

26
00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:05.070
The old man!

27
00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:06.070
The girl!

28
00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:07.070
The rat!

29
00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:09.070
And that damn rock!

30
00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:14.080
Fall back to the monument!

31
00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:16.080
Under the winged tower!

32
00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:19.080
The heavenbreaker still holds Lord Magnus Spirit.

33
00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:22.080
No dragon will dare cross that perimeter.

34
00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:37.340
Nowhere left to run, old man.

35
00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:39.340
The dragons can't cross, but we can.

36
00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:40.340
Dragon god.

37
00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:44.340
If there was ever a time for a miracle,

38
00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:46.340
now it is.
